; flags: --proofs
;
; Requirement: refusals and proofs work together.
;
; Observed: with --proofs, a function declared :no-merge is rejected before
; the program runs. The built-in way to refuse a merge (frictions 02, 03)
; and the built-in way to explain one cannot be used in the same run.

(sort Sheet)
(constructor sheet (String) Sheet)
(function inventory-name (Sheet) String :no-merge)

(set (inventory-name (sheet "a")) "a")
